  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Protective Presence to Support Palestinian Farmers &amp; Agri., OpT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Utilizing &#x201c;Unarmed Civilian Protection&#x201d; (UCP) as a tool to lower violence and raise security for Palestinian agricultural communities in the West Bank. RHR will place, train and monitor, staff and volunteers in local communities who are vulnerable and unprotected from rising Extremist Settler Violence (ESV). RHR&#x2019;s Protective Presence program will build on the organization&#x2019;s expertise in employing UCP to disincentivize violence and respond to ESV incidents in real time. Through building and managing a large network of activist volunteers RHR will bring hundreds to take part in protective presence and create visibility and pressure to address ESV and other human rights abuses faced by Palestinians in the West Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
